      "content": "If all the words, with or without meaning, are written using the letters of the word QUEEN and are arranged as in English dictionary, then the position of the word QUEEN is : ",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "44<sup>th</sup> "
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "45<sup>th</sup> "
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "46<sup>th</sup> "
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "47<sup>th</sup> "
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": "<p>To find the position of the word QUEEN:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> The number of words starting with E is 4! = 24.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> The number of words starting with N is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.52ex\" height=\"2.817ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -900.3 3323.7 1245.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"21\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(318.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"750.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1267.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2323.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> The number of words starting with QE is 3! = 6.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.124ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.131ex\" height=\"0.88ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -444 500 389\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2219\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2219\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Number of words starting with QN is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.388ex\" height=\"2.817ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -900.3 2823.7 1245.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"21\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(318.3,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"750.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1267.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2323.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the position of the word QUEEN is next to the sum, 24 + 12 + 6 + 3 = 45.</p>\n<p>That is, the word 'QUEEN' will be on 46th position.</p>"
